  "prefLabel": "Site 102.26 Landscape",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.26 “Landscape” means the characteristic, visible features of an area including landforms, water forms, vegetation, historic and cultural features and all other objects and aspects of natural and human origin.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15",
